cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "psm-analysis: annotated and MS2PIP mirror plots of peptide-spectrum matches for manual verification"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Malekos
    given-names: Eric
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ericmalekos/psm-analysis"
keywords:
  - proteomics
  - mass spectrometry
  - peptide-spectrum match
  - spectrum annotation
  - MS2PIP
  - proteogenomics
abstract: >-
  Annotates peptide-spectrum matches (PSMs) and mirrors them against MS2PIP predictions, for manual
  PSM verification: a b/y fragment-coverage map, the annotated observed MS2 spectrum, an
  observed-versus-MS2PIP mirror and an optional rubric grade. Reads MGF and mzML and handles TMT and
  TMTpro spectra.
